<title>LITHUANIA: KINNEVIK UNIT BUYS TELE 3 TV - REPORT.</title>
<headline>KINNEVIK UNIT BUYS TELE 3 TV - REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Modern Times Group, part of Swedish Kinnevik group, has bought the third-largest Lithuanian TV group, TELE 3, newspaper Lietuvos Rytas said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The newspaper quoted MTG president Pelle Tornberg as saying the company now owned 100 percent of TELE 3 shares.</p>
<p>The newspaper also said Swedish state fund Swedfund intends to acquire a 16 percent stake in the television station which will be renamed TV3 at the start of the summer.</p>
<p>The new owners declined to reveal the financial details of the deal, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 18</p>
